ipt shifts.</p><h3>What to watch</h3><p>The single biggest swing factor is <strong>availability</strong> \u2014 use the injury tool in the sidebar to mark anyone out; a starter's absence doesn't just remove his line, it <em>redistributes</em> his targets and carries to specific teammates, and the report and projections rebuild around it. Beyond that: if this game breaks toward the projected 3-point margin, the <strong>garbage-time backups</strong> (the \u25c6-flagged rows below) are where soft lines and real edge tend to appear \u2014 those depth players get fed in blowouts, and the market is slowest to price them.</p><p><em>This preview and the projections below regenerate through the week as injuries, weather and line moves update the inputs.</em></p></div>","teams":[{"team":"ATL","col":"#FF525B","players":[{"name":"Tua Tagovailoa","pos":"QB","starter":true,"minor":false,"markets":[{"label":"Pass yards","proj":207.82,"book":206.5,"over_th":156.65,"under_th":229.58,"over_am":"\u2212115","under_am":"\u2212115","pover":48,"call":"none","ev":-2.8,"edge":1.3,"skew":false},{"label":"Pass TDs","proj":1.39,"book":1.0,"over_th":1.09,"under_th":1.85,"over_am":"+110","under_am":"+108","pover":57,"call":"OVER","ev":19.1,"edge":0.4,"skew":false}],"td":{"pct":6.2,"fair":"16/1","book":"16/1","value":true},"d":{"pass_yards":{"m":207.82,"q":[0.0,17.93,191.33,382.57,575.51],"line":206.5,"od":1.87,"ud":1.87},"pass_td":{"m":1.39,"q":[0.0,0.0,1.36,3.8,3.8],"line":1.0,"od":2.1,"ud":2.08},"rush_yards":{"m":3.97,"q":[0.0,0.0,2.37,7.68,13.58],"line":2.0,"od":1.9,"ud":1.87},"rush_att":{"m":1.24,"q":[0.0,0.3,1.33,2.37,3.4],"line":null,"od":null,"ud":null}}},{"name":"Bijan Robinson","pos":"RB","starter":true,"minor":false,"markets":[{"label":"Rush yards","proj":74.87,"book":76.5,"over_th":59.27,"under_th":73.17,"over_am":"\u2212115","under_am":"\u2212115","pover":43,"call":"UNDER","ev":6.7,"edge":-1.6,"skew":true},{"label":"Carries","proj":15.64,"book":18.0,"over_th":13.27,"under_th":15.49,"